<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-29T17:01:06.689Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:01:06 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has sanctioned Rwanda's defence ministry for supporting M23 rebels and facilitating a gold smuggling network that moves through Uganda to fund an Islamic State-linked insurgency in eastern DRC. Gold smuggling is now identified as a financing channel for IS-backed rebels operating in the region. Ebola cases in the Democratic Republic of Congo have risen above 10,000, and a nurse treating patients was killed by a mob while another health worker was wounded. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm87zw51qw0jo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/29/world/africa/rwanda-sanctions-m23-congo.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBfb2tENi0ybW1icG5yNEJnVUtfRVItTUZ3VzItOXBQSXBMekVrMjFaYmlVRUhNM1lEWWt1U3FRZUdKWjJNTlJSMHd4QjRSdWdadklDcVR1Qk5ON3p5enfSAWNBVV95cUxQem8zMFBuVVdCV3EtMDdMekhmQUI5YzRJZlFHQmRxc3JvTkhwaml4ZUtQSEtPVVhEeVRfeUZFeUlUc3ppV1BTSmZtdHNtX2p5U3BRS05jVXQ2aGFpTEJXWGVYQVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNRDZzOUVtM2NMaExvWjV0aVNjam51ZmVVVmEyM1RmVm1ROTFoSFUzQk91OGJqUW90QzIyT3V6SUx2V0RXZXotOURZc05rNDc0RFJHcFJyNkcyU2lhMkwtRU1fd0c5ZFRuUEg3WExRaFo5REthcFFac01namE3MVhpMWRSVEY2Mjh1RGsyUVJyR3FGc3U0TUF3OXp1ZXA0ejdvUmp5TUJjZFFTb05fLUxtZWo2SzBEUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBWc3Y1ejlvUmpPa2p4NlR4MklKT2U2Y3RKMUdGem9RSHRvT1J0RUlndXI1ZFBFbTI1U1hYcUQ4clhVWDhlc1o1cHVGR2IyTFAwZFdUSVhjSDFMTUhIQ3fSAWNBVV95cUxPaGpKUmVMWnRZT1IyN1hESHVxZjhhaG8tYlFHaFV2cVFwajluLXVQWWVBbFpYbURxZzBIcVpSRDREcGp6VmpIUmo1TUhJUXVmOVYxbUpBbFVpMkhSR2